{"unit_id":"liustack__modlens#card-card-zh","repo":"liustack/modlens","commit":"ac278f885386f785dc1a35ddfbd8994bb5e744d7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ModLens 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的视觉插件，为纯文本模型提供图像理解。它注册 modlens_read_image 工具，并包装符合条件的文本模型路由；也可把粘贴图片转为本地路径，或从会话中恢复粘贴图像。分析结果包含 OCR 全文、版面区域、语义信息和不确定项。适合需要让文本模型读取截图、照片、图表或扫描件的 DSH 用户。需要配置可用的视觉引擎；设置由本机 ModLens CLI 管理。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:295","dsh/index.js:746","dsh/client.js:1","src/prompt.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"liustack__modlens#card-card-en","repo":"liustack/modlens","commit":"ac278f885386f785dc1a35ddfbd8994bb5e744d7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ModLens is a vision plugin for the DeepSeek Harness web client. It registers an image reading tool, wraps eligible text models, and can turn pasted images into local paths. Results include OCR, layout, semantics, and uncertainty notes. Users configure a vision engine through the local CLI.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:295","dsh/index.js:746","dsh/client.js:1","src/prompt.ts:1"]}
