{"unit_id":"liustack__modlens#feature-feature-1","repo":"liustack/modlens","commit":"ac278f885386f785dc1a35ddfbd8994bb5e744d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ModLens 的功能「image-tool」：通过 modlens_read_image 接收本地路径、HTTP(S) 图片链接或会话附件标识，并返回 OCR、版面、语义及不确定性证据。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:295","dsh/index.js:334"]}
